  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1464",
    "issue_date": "2026-11-08T12:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-11-08T12:03:32.556Z",
    "meteorologist": "Hari Dahal",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा पश्चिमी वायूको आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ ।",
    "analysis_en": "The country is currently under the partial influence of westerly winds.",
    "today_np": "देशको हिमाली भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्ने तथा बाँकी भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। तराई भू-भाग, उपत्यका तथा खोँचहरूमा बिहानपख थोरै स्थानमा हुस्सु/कुहिरो लाग्नेछ । गण्डकी र कर्णाली प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ।",
    "today_en": "Partly cloudy conditions will prevail over the Himalayan region of the country, while the weather will remain mainly fair over the rest of the country. There is a possibility of light rain/snowfall at one or two places in the Himalayan region of Gandaki and Karnali Provinces. Fog/mist is likely at a few places over the Terai region, valleys, and basins during the morning.",
    "tomorrow_np": "गण्डकी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भाग तथा कोशी, बागमती र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्ने र बाँकी भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका साथै कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशका हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा हल्का वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Partly cloudy conditions will prevail over the Himalayan and Hilly regions of Gandaki, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces, as well as the Himalayan regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Lumbini Provinces. The weather will remain mainly fair over the rest of the country.  There is a possibility of light rain/snowfall at one or two places in the Himalayan and Hilly regions of Karnali and Sudurpashchim Provinces, as well as in the Himalayan regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces.",
    "special": ""
  }
